id":"908f4682-db0e-11ef-823c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"908fbfc7-db0e-11ef-ba3d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"余吾水","place_name_jianti_auto":"余吾水","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"908fbfc8-db0e-11ef-90bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"908fbfc9-db0e-11ef-81f9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：於余吾水上作橋，擬有迫急，奔走避漢，從此橋度也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：于余吾水上作桥，拟有迫急，奔走避汉，从此桥度也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"908fbfc6-db0e-11ef-a723-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","place_note":"王庭设蒙古哈尔和林","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"908fd376-db0e-11ef-afea-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"受降城","place_name_jianti_auto":"受降城","place_note":"内蒙乌拉特中旗东五十公里新忽热","resolved_place_entity_id":1496,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"908fd377-db0e-11ef-9889-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"908fd378-db0e-11ef-ac12-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"余吾水","place_name_jianti_auto":"余吾水","place_note":"蒙古土拉河","resolved_place_entity_id":3571,"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"908fd379-db0e-11ef-a478-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"908fe73d-db0e-11ef-837a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"908fe73e-db0e-11ef-a4d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"908fe73f-db0e-11ef-809d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"908fe740-db0e-11ef-a0c5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"汉匈战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0568"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/九、北翟（卷四十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"宣帝本始元年，分道伐匈奴，田顺出五原塞八百余里，至丹余吾...","context_before":"...匈奴，匈奴悉远其累重于余吾水北，而以兵十万待水南，是也。","source_end_index":114,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8d0bb313-e20b-51df-9c85-ce237bd979d7","source_start_index":78,"source_text":"又昭帝元凤二年，匈奴复遣骑屯受降城以备汉，而北桥余吾水，令可度以备奔走。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/九、北翟（卷四十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十二、陕西行都指挥使司（卷六十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"二年，匈奴复遣骑屯受降城。宣帝甘露三年，呼韩邪单于入朝。...","context_before":"...东浚稽山南龙勒水上，徘徊观望，即无所见，还抵受降城休士。","source_end_index":109,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"13bfeecc-a365-5718-b7f5-e50f7b192e06","source_start_index":90,"source_text":"又昭帝元凤初，匈奴遣骑屯受降城以备汉。"},{"context_after":"宣帝甘露三年，呼韩邪单于入朝。既遣归，请留居幕南光禄塞，...","context_before":"...，还抵受降城休士。又昭帝元凤初，匈奴遣骑屯受降城以备汉。","source_end_index":122,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"13bfeecc-a365-5718-b7f5-e50f7b192e06","source_start_index":109,"source_text":"二年，匈奴复遣骑屯受降城。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十二、陕西行都指挥使司（卷六十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"3是歲，匈奴復遣九千騎屯受降城以備漢，北橋余吾水，令可度，以備奔走；欲求和親，而恐漢不聽，故不肯先言，常使左右風漢使者。然其侵盜益希，遇漢使愈厚，欲以漸致和親。漢亦羈縻之。","content_fanyi":"这一年，匈奴再次派遣九千骑兵屯驻受降城以防备汉朝，并在城北的余吾水上架桥，使兵马可以渡河，为情况不利时逃跑做准备；匈奴单于希望与汉朝和亲，但又担心汉朝不答应，所以不肯先提出，而是经常让身边的近臣暗示汉朝使者。不过，匈奴对汉朝边境的侵扰劫掠越来越少，对待汉朝使者也更加宽厚，想借此逐渐实现和亲。汉朝也对其采取笼络政策。","content_jianti_auto":"3是岁，匈奴复遣九千骑屯受降城以备汉，北桥余吾水，令可度，以备奔走；欲求和亲，而恐汉不听，故不肯先言，常使左右风汉使者。然其侵盗益希，遇汉使愈厚，欲以渐致和亲。汉亦羁縻之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1909,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"908fbfc4-db0e-11ef-93fd-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"二年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"二年","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"908f467d-db0e-11ef-8cfa-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（壬寅、前七九）","year_int":-79},"message":"success","success":true}